WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.040
Monday.

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:05.200
The vendor says: the sensor drifts after thirty days.

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.440
By Thursday it’s: may drift.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:11.450
By spring: totally reliable!

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.200
Nobody lied.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.860
The words just traveled.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.580
On day thirty-one, Fern finds out.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:21.890
Rewind.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:29.350
Memory keeps the first words in a jar: which project, which call, which day.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.530
Weeks later, ask what the vendor said,

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:40.030
and you get the exact words back, with where they came from.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.370
When a fact changes, the new one points to its source.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.400
The old one stays on the shelf.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:58.350
Memory.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.970
Find the original words, later.
